Scenario 4: Object Detection Model Shows Bounding Boxes but Misses Object

Project: Vehicle Detection using YOLOv5

Problem: Bounding boxes are displayed but are not aligned with objects correctly.

Cause: Incorrect YOLO label format or image resizing mismatch.

Solution:

Verify YOLO label format [class_id, x_center, y_center, width, height].
Ensure coordinates are normalized.
Use consistent image sizes during training and testing.
Validate annotation quality.

=============

Scenario 5: Model Gives High mAP on Training But Low Real-Time Accuracy

Project: Multi-Class Safety Equipment Detection using YOLOv8

Problem: The model achieves 90% mAP on the test set but performs poorly on real-time webcam input.

Cause: Resolution mismatch, camera angle differences, image quality issues, and dataset bias.

Solution:

Match webcam resolution with training data.
Collect webcam samples and fine-tune the model.
Improve dataset diversity.
Apply Test-Time Augmentation (TTA).

