Scenario 6: VGG16 Model Very Slow During Training

Project: Fashion Product Classification using VGG16

Problem: Model training is extremely slow even with a small dataset and batch size.

Cause: VGG16 contains a large number of parameters and requires significant computation.

Solution:

Freeze convolutional layers.
Use feature extraction mode.
Replace heavy fully connected layers with a lightweight classifier.
Reduce model complexity.


=========


Scenario 7: InceptionV3 Fails to Train Due to Input Size Mismatch

Project: Dog Breed Classification using InceptionV3

Problem: Runtime error occurs during training due to input image size mismatch.

Cause: InceptionV3 expects images of size 299×299, but a different image size is provided.

Solution:

Resize all images to 299×299.
Use the same size for training and validation datasets.
Verify the preprocessing pipeline.
Match the model input shape with image dimensions.





